From 2a0cf6e45bbf6ec9f55fc13f1a33b8aa313760de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Ihbe <mike.ihbe@sentry.io>
Date: Fri, 21 Nov 2025 23:55:59 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(grpc): Add gRPC-Web service for SCM integrations

- Implement gRPC-Web service exposing SCM integration capabilities via RPC
- Add authentication using symmetric keys from Sentry options
- Create thin proxy layer delegating to existing integration interfaces
- Provide client package with generated protobuf definitions
- Support both token-based and HMAC signature authentication
- Enable external services to interact with Sentry's SCM functionality
